{"seq":2,"slug":"framework-selection","title":"框架选型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-engineering/project-architecture/framework-selection","wordCount":712,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"框架选型\">框架选型</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>技术框架的选择不是一个纯技术问题——它深刻地影响着团队的招聘方向、开发效率、维护成本和技术债务。一个成熟的框架选型过程应当平衡技术能力、团队现状、生态成熟度和长期演进路线。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((框架选型))&#10;    技术维度&#10;      渲染模式&#10;      类型安全&#10;      性能特征&#10;      构建工具集成&#10;    团队维度&#10;      技术栈经验&#10;      学习曲线&#10;      招聘难度&#10;    生态维度&#10;      社区活跃度&#10;      第三方库丰富度&#10;      企业级支持&#10;    工程维度&#10;      Monorepo 兼容性&#10;      测试基础设施&#10;      CI/CD 集成\">mindmap\n  root((框架选型))\n    技术维度\n      渲染模式\n      类型安全\n      性能特征\n      构建工具集成\n    团队维度\n      技术栈经验\n      学习曲线\n      招聘难度\n    生态维度\n      社区活跃度\n      第三方库丰富度\n      企业级支持\n    工程维度\n      Monorepo 兼容性\n      测试基础设施\n      CI/CD 集成</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"主流框架对比\">主流框架对比</h2><h3 id=\"react-生态\">React 生态</h3><p>React 是目前前端领域使用最广泛的 UI 库。其&quot;只管视图层&quot;的哲学给了开发者极大的灵活性，但也意味着路由、状态管理等方案需要自行选择。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { useState } from &quot;react&quot;;&#10;&#10;interface CounterProps {&#10;  initialValue?: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function Counter({ initialValue = 0 }: CounterProps) {&#10;  const [count, setCount] = useState(initialValue);&#10;&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;div&gt;&#10;      &lt;p&gt;当前计数: {count}&lt;/p&gt;&#10;      &lt;button onClick={() =&gt; setCount((c) =&gt; c + 1)}&gt;+1&lt;/button&gt;&#10;    &lt;/div&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { useState } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"react\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CounterProps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  initialValue</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Counter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">initialValue</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CounterProps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">setCount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> useState</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(initialValue);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">div</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">当前计数</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">button onClick</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{() => </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">setCount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> + </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)}</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">button</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">div</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>React 的工程化优势：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>TypeScript 支持成熟，类型推导完善</li>\n<li>测试生态丰富（React Testing Library、Vitest）</li>\n<li>元框架成熟（Next.js、Remix）</li>\n<li>组件库生态最丰富（Ant Design、Radix、shadcn/ui）</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"vue-生态\">Vue 生态</h3><p>Vue 提供了更加&quot;电池内置&quot;的体验——官方维护路由（Vue Router）、状态管理（Pinia）、构建工具（Vite）形成了一套完整的官方栈。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"&lt;script setup lang=&quot;ts&quot;&gt;&#10;import { ref } from &quot;vue&quot;;&#10;&#10;interface Props {&#10;  initialValue?: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const props = withDefaults(defineProps&lt;Props&gt;(), {&#10;  initialValue: 0,&#10;});&#10;&#10;const count = ref(props.initialValue);&#10;&lt;/script&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;template&gt;&#10;  &lt;div&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;当前计数: {{ count }}&lt;/p&gt;&#10;    &lt;button @click=&quot;count++&quot;&gt;+1&lt;/button&gt;&#10;  &lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;/template&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">script setup lang</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ts\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { ref } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"vue\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Props</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  initialValue</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> props</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> withDefaults</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">defineProps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Props</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>(), {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  initialValue: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> count</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ref</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(props.initialValue);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">script</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">template</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">div</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">当前计数</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {{ count }}</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">p</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">button @click</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"count++\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">button</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">div</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">template</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span></code></pre></div><p>Vue 的工程化优势：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>官方工具链统一，选型成本低</li>\n<li>SFC（单文件组件）开发体验优秀</li>\n<li>Vite 原生支持，开发服务器启动极快</li>\n<li>渐进式采用，适合旧项目迁移</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"框架对比矩阵\">框架对比矩阵</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>React</th>\n<th>Vue 3</th>\n<th>Svelte</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>类型安全</td>\n<td>优秀（原生 TSX）</td>\n<td>优秀（<code>&lt;script setup&gt;</code> + 泛型）</td>\n<td>良好（TS 支持持续改进）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>渲染机制</td>\n<td>Virtual DOM + Fiber</td>\n<td>Proxy 响应式 + Virtual DOM</td>\n<td>编译时优化，无 Virtual DOM</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>包体积</td>\n<td>~40KB (gzipped)</td>\n<td>~33KB (gzipped)</td>\n<td>~2KB (运行时)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>学习曲线</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>较低</td>\n<td>较低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>企业级方案</td>\n<td>Next.js / Remix</td>\n<td>Nuxt</td>\n<td>SvelteKit</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>社区规模</td>\n<td>最大</td>\n<td>大</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>招聘市场</td>\n<td>最广</td>\n<td>广（国内尤其突出）</td>\n<td>较窄</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"元框架选型\">元框架选型</h2><p>元框架（Meta-framework）在 UI 框架基础上提供了路由、数据获取、服务端渲染、部署等完整的应用开发方案。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph UI 框架&#10;        REACT[React]&#10;        VUE[Vue]&#10;        SVELTE[Svelte]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 元框架&#10;        NEXT[Next.js]&#10;        REMIX[Remix]&#10;        NUXT[Nuxt]&#10;        KIT[SvelteKit]&#10;    end&#10;    REACT --&gt; NEXT&#10;    REACT --&gt; REMIX&#10;    VUE --&gt; NUXT&#10;    SVELTE --&gt; KIT\">graph LR\n    subgraph UI 框架\n        REACT[React]\n        VUE[Vue]\n        SVELTE[Svelte]\n    end\n    subgraph 元框架\n        NEXT[Next.js]\n        REMIX[Remix]\n        NUXT[Nuxt]\n        KIT[SvelteKit]\n    end\n    REACT --&gt; NEXT\n    REACT --&gt; REMIX\n    VUE --&gt; NUXT\n    SVELTE --&gt; KIT</pre><h3 id=\"next-js\">Next.js</h3><p>Next.js 是 React 生态中最成熟的全栈框架。App Router 引入了 React Server Components，支持 SSR、SSG、ISR 等多种渲染模式。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// app/users/page.tsx - Server Component (默认)&#10;async function UsersPage() {&#10;  const users = await fetch(&quot;https://api.example.com/users&quot;).then((r) =&gt;&#10;    r.json()&#10;  );&#10;&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;ul&gt;&#10;      {users.map((user: { id: number; name: string }) =&gt; (&#10;        &lt;li key={user.id}&gt;{user.name}&lt;/li&gt;&#10;      ))}&#10;    &lt;/ul&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}&#10;&#10;export default UsersPage;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// app/users/page.tsx - Server Component (默认)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> UsersPage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> users</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C