hiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"user.id\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{{ user.name }}</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">li</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ul</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">template</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"选型决策流程\">选型决策流程</h2><p>技术选型不应该是团队中某一个人的主观偏好，而应该是一个结构化的决策过程。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    START[启动选型] --&gt; REQUIREMENTS[梳理项目需求]&#10;    REQUIREMENTS --&gt; CANDIDATES[确定候选方案]&#10;    CANDIDATES --&gt; POC[Proof of Concept]&#10;    POC --&gt; MATRIX[评分矩阵打分]&#10;    MATRIX --&gt; REVIEW[团队评审]&#10;    REVIEW --&gt; DECISION[最终决策]&#10;    DECISION --&gt; ADR[记录 ADR]&#10;&#10;    REQUIREMENTS --&gt; R1[渲染模式需求]&#10;    REQUIREMENTS --&gt; R2[SEO 需求]&#10;    REQUIREMENTS --&gt; R3[性能要求]&#10;    REQUIREMENTS --&gt; R4[团队技术栈]\">flowchart TD\n    START[启动选型] --&gt; REQUIREMENTS[梳理项目需求]\n    REQUIREMENTS --&gt; CANDIDATES[确定候选方案]\n    CANDIDATES --&gt; POC[Proof of Concept]\n    POC --&gt; MATRIX[评分矩阵打分]\n    MATRIX --&gt; REVIEW[团队评审]\n    REVIEW --&gt; DECISION[最终决策]\n    DECISION --&gt; ADR[记录 ADR]\n\n    REQUIREMENTS --&gt; R1[渲染模式需求]\n    REQUIREMENTS --&gt; R2[SEO 需求]\n    REQUIREMENTS --&gt; R3[性能要求]\n    REQUIREMENTS --&gt; R4[团队技术栈]</pre><h3 id=\"评分矩阵示例\">评分矩阵示例</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface EvaluationCriteria {&#10;  name: string;&#10;  weight: number;&#10;  scores: Record&lt;string, number&gt;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const criteria: EvaluationCriteria[] = [&#10;  {&#10;    name: &#39;TypeScript 支持&#39;,&#10;    weight: 0.2,&#10;    scores: { &#39;Next.js&#39;: 9, Nuxt: 8, SvelteKit: 7 },&#10;  },&#10;  {&#10;    name: &#39;团队经验&#39;,&#10;    weight: 0.25,&#10;    scores: { &#39;Next.js&#39;: 8, Nuxt: 6, SvelteKit: 3 },&#10;  },&#10;  {&#10;    name: &#39;生态成熟度&#39;,&#10;    weight: 0.2,&#10;    scores: { &#39;Next.js&#39;: 9, Nuxt: 8, SvelteKit: 6 },&#10;  },&#10;  {&#10;    name: &#39;性能表现&#39;,&#10;    weight: 0.15,&#10;    scores: { &#39;Next.js&#39;: 8, Nuxt: 8, SvelteKit: 9 },&#10;  },&#10;  {&#10;    name: &#39;部署灵活性&#39;,&#10;    weight: 0.2,&#10;    scores: { &#39;Next.js&#39;: 7, Nuxt: 8, SvelteKit: 8 },&#10;  },&#10;];&#10;&#10;function calculateScore(framework: string): number {&#10;  return criteria.reduce((total, c) =&gt; total + c.scores[framework] * c.weight, 0);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> EvaluationCriteria</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  weight</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> 