span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'部署灵活性'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    weight: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    scores: { </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Next.js'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">7</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, Nuxt: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, SvelteKit: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> calculateScore</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">framework</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> criteria.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">reduce</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">total</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> total </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> c.scores[framework] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> c.weight, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"architecture-decision-record-adr\">Architecture Decision Record (ADR)</h3><p>每一次重要的技术选型都应该记录为 ADR，为后续团队成员提供决策上下文。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"markdown\" data-code=\"# ADR-001: 选择 Next.js 作为主站框架&#10;&#10;## 状态&#10;&#10;已采纳&#10;&#10;## 背景&#10;&#10;主站需要 SEO 支持、服务端渲染能力，团队 React 经验丰富。&#10;&#10;## 决策&#10;&#10;采用 Next.js App Router 作为主站技术框架。&#10;&#10;## 理由&#10;&#10;- 团队 80% 成员熟悉 React&#10;- App Router 的 Server Components 满足性能需求&#10;- Vercel 部署集成度高，运维成本低&#10;&#10;## 后果&#10;&#10;- 需要学习 Server Components 和 App Router 新范式&#10;- 与现有 REST API 的集成需要评估\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\"># ADR-001: 选择 Next.js 作为主站框架</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## 状态</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">已采纳</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## 背景</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">主站需要 SEO 支持、服务端渲染能力，团队 React 经验丰富。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## 决策</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">采用 Next.js App Router 作为主站技术框架。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## 理由</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 团队 80% 成员熟悉 React</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> App Router 的 Server Components 满足性能需求</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Vercel 部署集成度高，运维成本低</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## 后果</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 需要学习 Server Components 和 App Router 新范式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 与现有 REST API 的集成需要评估</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>框架选型是技术、团队、生态、工程四个维度的综合决策。</li>\n<li>React 生态最广、招聘最易；Vue 官方栈统一、学习曲线低；Svelte 编译时优化、包体积最小。</li>\n<li>元框架（Next.js、Nuxt、SvelteKit）已成为新项目的默认起点。</li>\n<li>选型应遵循结构化流程：需求分析 → 候选评估 → PoC 验证 → 评分打分 → 团队评审 → ADR 记录。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"框架选型","id":"框架选型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"主流框架对比","id":"主流框架对比"},{"level":3,"text":"React 生态","id":"react-生态"},{"level":3,"text":"Vue 生态","id":"vue-生态"},{"level":3,"text":"框架对比矩阵","id":"框架对比矩阵"},{"level":2,"text":"元框架选型","id":"元框架选型"},{"level":3,"text":"Next.js","id":"next-js"},{"level":3,"text":"Nuxt","id":"nuxt"},{"level":2,"text":"选型决策流程","id":"选型决策流程"},{"level":3,"text":"评分矩阵示例","id":"评分矩阵示例"},{"level":3,"text":"Architecture Decision Record (ADR)","id":"architecture-decision-record-adr"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Monorepo 架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-engineering/project-architecture/monorepo-structure"},"next":{"title":"目录约定","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-engineering/project-architecture/directory-conventions"}}